   b=256 a=    1: best m=3: solver/attempt 2.481e+02 bits, calls 96.5, lin.alg 276.8; total 3.446e+02 bits vs rho 128, enumeration/attempt 170.7
   b=256 a= 2600: best m=2: solver/attempt 2.951e+05 bits, calls 138.0, lin.alg 403.0; total 2.953e+05 bits vs rho 128, enumeration/attempt 128.0
