== Crossover conditions (c=1)
   Bochum below rho (blackbox balance E_min = 2b sqrt(a c)/(log2 b)^(1/4) < b/2): log2 b > 256 (a c)^2
     a=1: log2 b > 2.560e+02  (b > 2^2.560e+02 bits)
     a=2600: log2 b > 1.731e+09  (b > 2^1.731e+09 bits)
     a=6000: log2 b > 9.216e+09  (b > 2^9.216e+09 bits)
   Solver beats naive enumeration per attempt at fixed m: sqrt(log2 s) > a c m^2/(m-1)
     a=1 m=2: log2 s > 1.600e+01
     a=1 m=3: log2 s > 2.025e+01
     a=1 m=4: log2 s > 2.844e+01
     a=2600 m=2: log2 s > 1.082e+08
     a=2600 m=3: log2 s > 1.369e+08
     a=2600 m=4: log2 s > 1.923e+08
   LEAD-ICB form of the obstruction (N = omega(l sqrt(log l)) variables): s = a m^2 l is LINEAR in l,
   so the literal obstruction does NOT apply; the closure rests on admission and on the constants above.
